Description: Islamic Prayer Times and Athan Notification
 Athan App is a comprehensive Islamic prayer times application for
 Ubuntu/GNOME desktop. It calculates prayer times based on your location
 and plays the Athan (call to prayer) at the appropriate times.
 .
 Features:
  - Accurate prayer time calculation (ISNA, MWL, and other methods)
  - Background service for reliable Athan playback
  - Top panel indicator with countdown
  - Configurable audio output device
  - Support for custom Athan audio files
  - Per-prayer enable/disable
  - System tray integration
